From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: robgallardof <robgallardof@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 23:07:29 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Make the project installable with uv; plain `pytest` works;
 fix undefined ToolSchema

- pyproject [tool.uv] conflicts: the `audio` extra (demucs 4.1.0, numpy<2 on
  Intel macOS) and the `background-removal` extra (rembg 2.0.76, numpy>=2.3) can
  never share an environment. uv refused to lock the project, so every
  `uv sync` / `uv run` failed with "requirements are unsatisfiable". Declaring
  the conflict lets uv resolve both extras separately.
- pytest pythonpath = ["."]: the tests import `src.davinci_mcp`, so only
  `python -m pytest` worked; plain `pytest` failed to collect all 5 files.
- tools/__init__.py: import ToolSchema. It was used in an annotation without
  being imported (ruff F821), and anything that resolves the type hints raised
  NameError.

78/78 tests pass with `uv run pytest`.
---
 pyproject.toml                    | 10 ++++++++++
 src/davinci_mcp/tools/__init__.py |  1 +
 2 files changed, 11 insertions(+)

diff --git a/pyproject.toml b/pyproject.toml
index 983bfd4..39aa8b5 100644
--- a/pyproject.toml
+++ b/pyproject.toml
@@ -29,8 +29,18 @@ background-removal = [
 Repository = "https://github.com/kerwilgil/davinci-resolve-mcp"
 Issues = "https://github.com/kerwilgil/davinci-resolve-mcp/issues"
 
+[tool.uv]
+# demucs 4.1.0 needs numpy<2 on Intel macOS while rembg 2.0.76 needs numpy>=2.3: the two
+# extras can never share an environment. Declaring the conflict lets uv lock and run the
+# project (before this, every `uv sync` / `uv run` failed with "requirements are unsatisfiable").
+conflicts = [
+    [{ extra = "audio" }, { extra = "background-removal" }],
+]
+
 [tool.pytest.ini_options]
 testpaths = ["tests"]
+# tests import `src.davinci_mcp...`: without this only `python -m pytest` worked, plain `pytest` failed
+pythonpath = ["."]
 
 [tool.ruff]
 target-version = "py311"
diff --git a/src/davinci_mcp/tools/__init__.py b/src/davinci_mcp/tools/__init__.py
index 65b19d2..4ed96be 100644
--- a/src/davinci_mcp/tools/__init__.py
+++ b/src/davinci_mcp/tools/__init__.py
@@ -9,6 +9,7 @@ from collections.abc import Callable
 from ..schemas import (
     ToolCategory,
     ToolMode,
+    ToolSchema,
     VERIFIED_TOOLS,
     get_schema,
     is_verified,
